  {
   "title": "More than one person: kina",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "type": "p",
     "t": "When the indirect object is **plural**, the plurality rule from Lesson 4 applies. With names, **para kay** and **kay** change to **[[para kina|marker]]** and **[[kina|marker]]**."
    },
    {
     "type": "p",
     "t": "Nothing changes with **para sa** or **sa**, because the pronouns already have plural forms of their own, such as **para sa kanila** or **sa amin**."
