     "title": "Also in the book's list",
     "t": "The list also includes *He sold the shoes of John* and *She went with Charles to the Post Office*. Look for the phrases in them too. The book also asks you to write ten sentences with pronouns as indirect objects, then change the pronouns to names of persons (sa → kay, para sa → para kay)."
